            "item_body_color": "",
            "item_body_size_desktop": 14,
            "item_body_size_mobile": 13,
            "item_1_title": "Description",
            "item_1_body": "<p>Elevate your morning routine with the Ninja Luxe™ Café Mini Espresso Machine. Designed to eliminate the steep learning curve of traditional espresso setups, this compact 3-in-1 coffee station delivers barista-quality espresso, smooth drip coffee, and rapid cold brew right on your kitchen counter. Featuring Barista Assist technology and an automated hands-free milk frother, you can craft lattes, cappuccinos, and iced drinks with effortless precision every single day.</p>",
            "item_2_title": "Key Features",
            "item_2_body": "<p>• <strong>3-in-1 Brewing System:</strong> Effortlessly switch between authentic espresso (single, double, or quad shots), classic drip coffee, and cold-pressed coffee in minutes.</p><p>• <strong>Hands-Free Microfoam Frother:</strong> Built-in automatic steam wand creates silky microfoam for latte art or thick foam for cappuccinos, with dedicated settings for oat, almond, and dairy milk.</p><p>• <strong>Rapid Cold Brew:</strong> Brew smooth, naturally sweet cold coffee in under 3 minutes without waiting 12 to 24 hours.</p><p>• <strong>Space-Saving Design:</strong> Slim, ultra-compact profile specifically crafted to maximize counter space in apartments and modern kitchens.</p><p>• <strong>Intuitive Touch Controls:</strong> Simple one-touch presets take the guesswork out of temperature, pressure, and extraction time.</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "item_3_body": "<p>• <strong>Canada-Wide Delivery:</strong> Fast 2–5 business day delivery across all provinces with tracking included.</p><p>• <strong>Zero Customs Fees:</strong> Shipped with all taxes handled at checkout—100% guaranteed no surprise duties on arrival.</p><p>• <strong>30-Day Trial:</strong> Try the Ninja Luxe™ Café Mini at home for 30 days. If you are not completely satisfied, return it for a refund. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• <strong>Warranty:</strong> Includes a 1-Year Limited Manufacturer Warranty covering electrical and mechanical components.</p>",
            "item_4_title": "What's in the Box?",
            "item_4_body": "<p>• 1x Ninja Luxe™ Café Mini Espresso Machine (Black Finish)</p><p>• 1x High-Pressure Portafilter</p><p>• 2x Precision Filter Baskets (Single & Double Shot)</p><p>• 1x Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher</p><p>• 1x Ergonomic Coffee Tamper & Scoop</p><p>• 1x Removable Water Reservoir & User Guide</p>",
            "item_5_title": "Technical Specs",
            "item_5_body": "<p>• <strong>Pump Pressure:</strong> Optimal 15-Bar Italian pressure pump</p><p>• <strong>Power / Voltage:</strong> 120V / 60Hz (Standard Canadian wall outlet compatible)</p><p>• <strong>Brew Modes:</strong> Espresso, Drip Coffee, Rapid Cold Brew, Hot Water</p><p>• <strong>Milk Frothing Settings:</strong> Steamed Milk, Microfoam, Thick Froth, Cold Foam</p><p>• <strong>Water Tank Capacity:</strong> 1.5 L (50 oz) removable tank with level markings</p><p>• <strong>Dimensions:</strong> Compact counter-depth build (approx. 33 cm H x 20 cm W x 30 cm D)</p>",
            "item_6_title": "",
            "item_6_body": ""
          }
        },
